    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost soul is a roguelite action-platformer. inspired by deadcells, and hades. You'll\u00a0explore an ever-changing Tower with a 2D souls-lite combat. and try to uncover the mysteries behind the tower and the history of its world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a roguelite action-platformer with soul-lite combat. A precise combat and controls that will test your reflexes. With progression inspired by games like hades and deadcells </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost soul is a roguelite action-platformer where you play as kid who wakes up in a strange tower. Lost and confused he sets on the path of exploring this tower to find a way back home. Along the way he meets friends foes and opportunities to get stronger. Would he be able to uncover the secrets of the tower? Would he ever see his home again? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-lite combat with precise controls. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn frame by frame animations and art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast interconnected ever-changing Tower of unknown origins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your new abilities. Grow to new heights to defeat stronger enemies and unveil the mysteries of the Tower. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost soul is a roguelite action-platformer. inspired by deadcells, and hades. You'll\u00a0explore an ever-changing Tower with a 2D souls-lite combat. and try to uncover the mysteries behind the tower and the history of its world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a roguelite action-platformer with soul-lite combat. A precise combat and controls that will test your reflexes. With progression inspired by games like hades and deadcells </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost soul is a roguelite action-platformer where you play as kid who wakes up in a strange tower. Lost and confused he sets on the path of exploring this tower to find a way back home. Along the way he meets friends foes and opportunities to get stronger. Would he be able to uncover the secrets of the tower? Would he ever see his home again? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-lite combat with precise controls. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn frame by frame animations and art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast interconnected ever-changing Tower of unknown origins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your new abilities. Grow to new heights to defeat stronger enemies and unveil the mysteries of the Tower. </p></li></ul>",
